1
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:16,230
Why limit yourself to just 88 keys?

2
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:20,140
The music is out there. You just have to listen.

3
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:24,720
I was born on this ship, and the world passed me by.


4
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:29,680
But two thousand people at a time, that's an entire universe.


5
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:34,560
Take piano. Keys begin, keys end.


6
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:39,120
You know there are 88 of them. Nobody can tell you differently.


7
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:44,440
They are not infinite. You are infinite.


8
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:49,600
And on those keys, the music that you can make is infinite.
